           • enforces safety thresholds
           • maintains clarity standards
           • blocks unsafe clarity states

       WRSADC is the clarity conductor.

NOTES
       Resonance clarity transforms resonance-time into a high-fidelity sensor
       domain. Sharpening, filtering, and enhancement techniques ensure that
       sweep choreography, harmonic-lock, and constellation-scale synchronization
       remain stable across long mission timelines.

